^[a-z]{1,}[a-z0-9:]{1,}/[a-z0-9]{0,}\\[a-z]{1,}$

conditions:-
1. starts with any character between a-z only.
2.then any number, any alphabet and ':' characters only of any length.
3.then '/' character
4. then zero or more characters of either alphabet or digit type only.
5.then '\' character
6. then any character between a-z of any length.

Ex:-
xyz123c:bv/12abvc12\abc
